cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this framework, please cite it.
title: "Reading Regulatory Order: Five Analytical Layers"
abstract: >-
  An analytical framework for reading selected AI-governance cases through five
  parallel layers: Classification, Formation, Manifestation, Distribution, and
  Re-formation. The layers are read side by side rather than as a process sequence.

type: software
